@find
@FIND

Syntax: '@find <search string>'
        '@find [-<type>] <search string>'

Parameters:

  n   npcs    (ONLY!)
  p   players (ONLY!)
  r   rooms   (ONLY!)
  
NOTE: search string checks for presence of the literal string given,
except when it is simply an asterisk (simple wild card for all objects of that type).

